  rdfs:comment           "Provides Input For Rule. The relation 'SPI1 (PU.1) gene transcription is stimulated by RUNX1:CBFB:KMT2A' 'null' 'SPI1 (PU.1), CEBPA and DEK bind the promoter of the CSF3R (G-CSFR) gene' was inferred because:\n reaction1 has an output that is an input of reaction 2. " , "Imported from Reactome: https://reactome.org/content/detail/R-HSA-9616222" ;
